{"about_the_game":"<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2522300/extras/83a6636820597e71d07456d8177727b4.avif?t=1701659236\" width=616 height=382 /></span><br>Defend against hordes of zombies in this immersive VR RPG. Strategize, fight, and survive in the ultimate zombie apocalypse experience!<br><br><strong>INTRODUCTION:</strong><br>Welcome to Tactical Rampart, the most intense and immersive zombie survival game! If you're a fan of action, strategy, and heart-pounding combat, this is the game for you.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2522300/extras/2142af0a4ddea21aafc20b262e3f2c0c.poster.avif?t=1701659236\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2522300/extras/2142af0a4ddea21aafc20b262e3f2c0c.webm?t=1701659236\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2522300/extras/2142af0a4ddea21aafc20b262e3f2c0c.mp4?t=1701659236\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>In Tactical Rampart, you will face the relentless onslaught of the undead in a post-apocalyptic world. Your mission is to protect the rampart, use guns and strategically position towers to destroy zombies. This is not your ordinary zombie shooter; it's a tactical RPG that will test your wits and combat skills.<br><br><strong>KEY FEATURE:</strong><br><br>Tactical Brilliance: Plan your defenses, position towers, and use guns strategically to protect your rampart. Every decision matters.<br><br>Diverse Maps: Each map provides a fresh and distinct experience, requiring adaptation and creativity to safeguard your fortress.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam